    477.0,
    526.4,
    536.0
   ],
   "ocr": "The fair value of stock options granted is estimated using a binomial option-pricing model. The binomial model \nrequires the input of assumptions. The Company uses historical data to estimate exercise, employee termination and \nexpected stock price volatility within the binomial model. The risk-free rate for periods within the contractual life of \nthe option is based on the U.S. Treasury yield curve in effect at the time of grant. No options were granted in 2019 or \n2018. The fair value of stock options granted in 2017 was estimated using the following weighted average assumptions:"
  },
